 "comment": "RF-DETR (Roboflow, Apache-2.0) nano detection and seg-nano checkpoints, the upstream model code they run with, and the reference-case photos. SHA-256 of every upstream source file the harness imports or reads, of each checkpoint (also checked against upstream's own MD5 in assets/model_weights.py) and of each photo, pinned 2026-11-06. Upstream's LICENSE, README and docs/snippets/license-rfdetr.md give the rfdetr package, Nano/Small/Medium/Large detection and every Seg size as Apache-2.0; only the rfdetr[plus] sizes (Atto, Femto, Pico, XLarge, 2XLarge) are PML 1.0, and none of them is used.",
